      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_9fc5372a",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts former President Barack Obama and First Lady Michelle Obama in an affectionate embrace, overlaid with text that reads 'happy pride month y'all', 'disney proudly presents', and 'the gentleman and the tranny'. The juxtaposition of the loving, public image of the Obamas with the derogatory term 'tranny' (a slur for transgender people) is intentionally offensive and hateful. The meme uses the visual of a respected public figure to mock or demean transgender individuals, framing them as 'the tranny' in a demeaning context. This constitutes a direct attack on transgender people based on their gender identity, falling under the category of hateful content as defined in the provided knowledge base. The use of the term 'tranny' is a clear example of LGBTQ+ discrimination through the use of a derogatory slur, and the meme's intent is to demean and insult the transgender community by associating it with a well-known, respected couple in a mocking way.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c3cbe539"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
