      "description": "The user is projected onto the derogatory textual material 'the tranny' which is explicitly mapped to Michelle Obama in the meme. The meme uses the user's perspective to confront them with the offensive term, implying the user is being asked to identify with or accept the dehumanizing label. This projection is implicit through the meme's framing, which forces the viewer to associate the respected public figure with the slur, thereby projecting the user into the role of the one who must confront or internalize this insult.",
